{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07364","headline":"初贬南巴至鄱阳题李嘉佑江亭 · 刘长卿","name":"初贬南巴至鄱阳题李嘉佑江亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巴峤南行远，长江万里随。\n不才甘谪去，流水亦何之。\n地远明君弃，天高酷吏欺。\n清山独往路，芳草未归时。\n流落还相见，悲懽话所思。\n猜嫌伤薏苡，愁暮向江篱。\n柳色迎高坞，荷衣照下帷。\n水云初起重，暮鸟远来迟。\n白首看长劒，沧洲寄钓丝。\n沙鸥惊小吏，湖月上高枝。\n稚子能吴语，新文怨楚辞。\n怜君不得意，川谷自逶迤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}